/*
 * Engineering/mechanical stats for the utility outfitting modules, keyed by the
 * same Frontier `symbol` as data/ships/modules-utility.jsonc. Join the two on
 * `symbol` to pair a module's identity with its stats.
 *
 * Source:  EDCD/coriolis-data, modules/** (commit 0db9234b5b9ce8c939ea84133d7ce336eea88e27)
 *          https://github.com/EDCD/coriolis-data
 *          The JSON stat values are Elite Dangerous game data, property of
 *          Frontier Developments plc, redistributed under Frontier's media-usage
 *          terms: https://forums.frontier.co.uk/threads/510879/
 *
 * `name` is the module's display name (from the registry). `restrictedToShips`
 * lists the hull symbol(s) a module is limited to (the few non-armour restricted
 * modules; armour's hull restriction lives in the registry). Every other field is
 * optional, present only where the module has it: mass (t), integrity, powerDraw
 * (MW), bootTime (s); optMass/minMass/maxMass (t) and optMultiplier/minMultiplier/
 * maxMultiplier (thruster speed or shield strength); maxFuel (t/jump), fuelMul,
 * fuelPower (FSD); jumpBoost (LY, Guardian FSD booster); powerCapacity (MW),
 * heatEfficiency (power plant); weapons/engines/systems Capacity+Recharge (power
 * distributor); fuelCapacity / cargoCapacity (t); shieldRegenRate/
 * shieldBrokenRegenRate, shieldBoost. Weapon combat stats are not carried.
 *
 * Full provenance: data/ships/SOURCES.md.
 */
